# Security headers for blueerp.me (Cloudflare Workers static assets).
# The site is one self-contained HTML file: inline <style>, an inline SVG
# data-URI favicon, no scripts, no external requests. The CSP below is written
# to allow exactly that and nothing else.
#
# Note: HSTS deliberately omits includeSubDomains/preload — api.* and client1.*
# are tunnel hostnames serving desktop clients, and this site should not dictate
# transport policy for them.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
